The US military blogger "Jomini of the West" is tweeting that the military initiative on the battlefield is shifting from Russia to Ukraine. The next few weeks could prove to be as critical "as the early days of the war." For the British intelligence service, too, the war is facing a new phase. At the Aspen Security Forum in the US state of Colorado, MI6 chief Richard Moore said weeks ago regarding [Gruppe 1], "I believe they will soon run out of air."

The American historian Timothy Snyder of Yale University has explained many times in his blogs and tweets why he sees [Gruppe 1] on the road to defeat for many reasons:

Because the sought-after blitzkrieg has failed to materialize;

